      - Also still true: the name the model actually asked for in that dead chat is unrecoverable - api_monitor
        keeps what the CLIENT received, and the call never reached it.  Only the new counter can name it.
      - THE SPECIMEN, recorded 2026-11-21 - the counters named a death on this box for the first time.  Two
        lines, one turn: "1 tool call(s) the model opened and never finished: dropped, no call ran" and
