    NO NARRATION (the human, sharply: "NEVER say super obvious things like `Applied as you click. A conversation
    whose tool list changed reads its history again.` That's just dumb").  The rule is now in AGENTS.md under
    "Working on the code": never write UI text that states what the user already knows; say only what is not
